WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.433 --> 00:00:02.035
An EPA source says the

00:00:02.035 --> 00:00:03.603
agency has not fully accepted

00:00:03.603 --> 00:00:04.437
Norfolk Southern's

00:00:04.437 --> 00:00:05.405
remediation plan

00:00:05.405 --> 00:00:06.639
regarding the toxic train

00:00:06.639 --> 00:00:08.341
derailment in eastern Ohio.

00:00:08.341 --> 00:00:10.877
This as residents and farmers living near

00:00:10.877 --> 00:00:11.478
the derailment

00:00:11.478 --> 00:00:13.213
site are waiting for answers

00:00:13.213 --> 00:00:13.546
as to

00:00:13.546 --> 00:00:15.382
whether their health is in jeopardy.

00:00:15.382 --> 00:00:18.385
Here's CNN's Miguel Marquez.

00:00:18.385 --> 00:00:19.152
Come on, girls.

00:00:19.152 --> 00:00:21.021
Come on, girls. Come on, girls.

00:00:21.021 --> 00:00:22.922
Dave Anderson raises grass fed

00:00:22.922 --> 00:00:24.324
beef four miles

00:00:24.324 --> 00:00:26.760
downwind of East Palestine, Ohio.

00:00:26.793 --> 00:00:28.194
After the derailment, fire

00:00:28.194 --> 00:00:30.230
and venting of toxic chemicals.

00:00:30.730 --> 00:00:33.033
This is what drifted over

00:00:33.133 --> 00:00:35.001
his Echo Valley farm.

00:00:35.001 --> 00:00:36.002
As far as the smoke,

00:00:36.002 --> 00:00:38.405
you could probably see 100 yards.

00:00:38.405 --> 00:00:39.406
You know, it was dark

00:00:39.406 --> 00:00:41.374
and what did you experience?

00:00:41.374 --> 00:00:42.308
Burning eyes,

00:00:42.308 --> 00:00:44.377
burning throat, burning mouth.

00:00:44.377 --> 00:00:46.179
The cloud from the toxic

00:00:46.179 --> 00:00:49.115
spill settled on his pastures and ponds.

00:00:49.449 --> 00:00:50.050
The question

00:00:50.050 --> 00:00:52.052
he now cannot answer

00:00:52.052 --> 00:00:54.120
are the cattle he's raised for years.

00:00:54.254 --> 00:00:56.322
Okay for human consumption.

00:00:56.623 --> 00:00:57.957
Customers are buying grass fed

00:00:57.957 --> 00:00:59.626
beef directly from a farmer

00:00:59.626 --> 00:01:02.128
They care about their food.

00:01:02.128 --> 00:01:03.430
They want to know what they're getting.

00:01:03.430 --> 00:01:05.031
They want to know what top notch

00:01:05.031 --> 00:01:06.232
and healthy for them.

00:01:06.232 --> 00:01:08.501
He's now sued Norfolk Southern.

00:01:08.668 --> 00:01:11.571
He also wants testing a process,

00:01:11.571 --> 00:01:14.607
a way to certify his livestock is safe.

00:01:14.641 --> 00:01:16.009
The lawsuit is about peace of mind

00:01:16.009 --> 00:01:17.110
to start with. Right.

00:01:17.110 --> 00:01:19.012
And information and make decisions

00:01:19.012 --> 00:01:21.648
Solid information here. Tough to come by.

00:01:21.648 --> 00:01:22.949
Officials have established

00:01:22.949 --> 00:01:24.851
a two mile zone around the derailment

00:01:24.851 --> 00:01:26.853
site as a priority

00:01:26.853 --> 00:01:28.088
because Anderson's farm

00:01:28.088 --> 00:01:29.255
is farther away,

00:01:29.255 --> 00:01:30.690
despite being directly

00:01:30.690 --> 00:01:31.758
in the path of the plume

00:01:31.758 --> 00:01:33.093
from the toxic spill.

00:01:33.093 --> 00:01:35.395
He's yet received little support

00:01:35.395 --> 00:01:36.596
and no answers

00:01:36.596 --> 00:01:37.564
from Pennsylvania's

00:01:37.564 --> 00:01:38.131
Department

00:01:38.131 --> 00:01:40.667
of Environmental Protection DEP.

00:01:40.800 --> 00:01:43.136
What will assuage your concerns?

00:01:43.570 --> 00:01:45.572
Testing. But there has been no testing.

00:01:45.572 --> 00:01:46.072
None.

00:01:46.072 --> 00:01:47.407
None so deep

00:01:47.407 --> 00:01:48.641
he's not been out here at all.

00:01:48.641 --> 00:01:49.509
If he came yesterday

00:01:49.509 --> 00:01:51.344
for the first time, four weeks

00:01:51.344 --> 00:01:52.512
after the event,

00:01:52.512 --> 00:01:53.880
a little more than four weeks after,

00:01:53.880 --> 00:01:55.248
they've they test, they take samples.

00:01:55.248 --> 00:01:55.982
They did not.

00:01:55.982 --> 00:01:57.250
They were investigating

00:01:57.250 --> 00:01:59.452
whether they should

00:01:59.452 --> 00:02:01.988
be active in this area outside of the two

00:02:01.988 --> 00:02:02.856
mile ring.

00:02:02.856 --> 00:02:03.723
The crash occurred

00:02:03.723 --> 00:02:06.326
just feet from the Pennsylvania border.

00:02:06.359 --> 00:02:07.527
The winds typically

00:02:07.527 --> 00:02:09.562
blow east toward Pennsylvania.

00:02:09.796 --> 00:02:11.564
The state is going house

00:02:11.564 --> 00:02:12.031
to house,

00:02:12.031 --> 00:02:12.832
testing soil

00:02:12.832 --> 00:02:14.234
and water in areas

00:02:14.234 --> 00:02:16.035
closest to the derailment.

00:02:16.035 --> 00:02:17.270
What did you see that night?

00:02:18.271 --> 00:02:18.805
Standing at

00:02:18.805 --> 00:02:21.908
the end of the driveway, I saw

00:02:22.575 --> 00:02:23.676
a huge plume of smoke.

00:02:23.676 --> 00:02:25.778
I saw flames above the treetops,

00:02:25.778 --> 00:02:27.147
well over 100 feet in the air

00:02:27.147 --> 00:02:28.815
and it was terrifying.

00:02:28.815 --> 00:02:29.682
Samuel Wenger

00:02:29.682 --> 00:02:30.650
and his wife, Joyce,

00:02:30.650 --> 00:02:31.851
had their fourth

00:02:31.851 --> 00:02:34.320
child, Jaxson Hayes, a week ago.

00:02:34.621 --> 00:02:36.156
He says the state's response

00:02:36.156 --> 00:02:37.357
has been too slow

00:02:37.357 --> 00:02:38.825
and lacking in information

00:02:38.825 --> 00:02:39.125
to know

00:02:39.125 --> 00:02:40.360
whether his town

00:02:40.360 --> 00:02:41.995
of Darlington, Pennsylvania,

00:02:41.995 --> 00:02:44.430
is still a safe place to raise a family.

00:02:44.564 --> 00:02:45.465
Have you tested your well

00:02:45.465 --> 00:02:46.533
or has it been tested?

00:02:46.533 --> 00:02:47.834
It was tested today

00:02:47.834 --> 00:02:48.601
and we were told

00:02:48.601 --> 00:02:49.869
will be another three weeks

00:02:49.869 --> 00:02:51.004
until we get results.

00:02:51.004 --> 00:02:52.805
Wenger who works in landscaping,

00:02:52.805 --> 00:02:55.842
says they evacuated for four days,

00:02:55.842 --> 00:02:58.778
but moving permanently isn't an option.

00:02:59.045 --> 00:02:59.412
How tough

00:02:59.412 --> 00:03:01.581
was it to come back to this house

00:03:02.048 --> 00:03:04.050
knowing that you bring a newborn here?

00:03:04.050 --> 00:03:04.751
I feel like I

00:03:06.486 --> 00:03:08.254
possibly regret the decision every day,

00:03:08.254 --> 00:03:12.091
but here we live paycheck to paycheck.

00:03:12.091 --> 00:03:14.861
We live within our means and

00:03:14.861 --> 00:03:16.496
we don't have the financial luxury

00:03:16.496 --> 00:03:18.198
to pack up and move.

00:03:18.198 --> 00:03:20.967
We just it's scary.

00:03:21.601 --> 00:03:24.370
The CDC is now conducting a health survey

00:03:24.370 --> 00:03:25.238
in and around

00:03:25.238 --> 00:03:26.239
East Palestine,

00:03:26.239 --> 00:03:28.074
trying to determine the long

00:03:28.074 --> 00:03:30.076
term effects on human health.

00:03:30.076 --> 00:03:30.710
While air

00:03:30.710 --> 00:03:32.245
and water testing is occurring,

00:03:32.245 --> 00:03:35.215
daily answers about long term health

00:03:35.682 --> 00:03:36.883
won't come quickly.

00:03:36.883 --> 00:03:39.352
We are hoping in the next couple of weeks

00:03:39.352 --> 00:03:40.887
to be able to have collected

00:03:40.887 --> 00:03:42.956
all of the information that we need

00:03:42.956 --> 00:03:43.890
and then those results

00:03:43.890 --> 00:03:46.226
will be available in the coming months.

00:03:46.226 --> 00:03:47.493
For Pennsylvania residents

00:03:47.493 --> 00:03:48.828
and business owners

00:03:48.828 --> 00:03:51.731
downwind of the toxic fire Answers

00:03:52.365 --> 00:03:53.900
can't come soon enough.

00:03:53.900 --> 00:03:55.168
But you're losing business

00:03:55.168 --> 00:03:56.603
because people aren't sure

00:03:56.603 --> 00:03:58.171
it's safe to eat your food.

00:03:58.171 --> 00:03:59.405
Yeah, I think so.

00:03:59.405 --> 00:04:01.474
I lost the wedding over that

00:04:01.474 --> 00:04:02.642
catering job.

00:04:02.642 --> 00:04:04.244
They just they don't know.

00:04:04.244 --> 00:04:04.677
I mean,

00:04:04.711 --> 00:04:05.578
I don't think there's

00:04:05.578 --> 00:04:06.679
anything wrong with anything,

00:04:06.679 --> 00:04:07.680
but I don't know either.

00:04:08.881 --> 00:04:10.083
It must hurt.

00:04:10.083 --> 00:04:11.751
Yeah, it sucks.

00:04:12.085 --> 00:04:12.919
I'm sorry.

00:04:12.919 --> 00:04:13.987
I don't know how else to put it.

00:04:13.987 --> 00:04:16.823
It's just the uncertainty.

00:04:16.990 --> 00:04:18.424
Pennsylvania officials have pushed back

00:04:18.424 --> 00:04:19.892
pretty hard on the notion

00:04:19.892 --> 00:04:20.727
that not enough

00:04:20.727 --> 00:04:22.262
is being done in this area.

00:04:22.262 --> 00:04:23.463
They say they've tested

00:04:23.463 --> 00:04:24.631
nearly every well

00:04:24.631 --> 00:04:25.531
within a two mile

00:04:25.531 --> 00:04:27.567
radius of the derailment,

00:04:27.567 --> 00:04:29.302
and those results will be in soon.

00:04:29.302 --> 00:04:31.537
They have a plan to sample soil

00:04:31.537 --> 00:04:32.572
throughout the area as well.

00:04:32.572 --> 00:04:33.973
They've worked with animal experts

00:04:33.973 --> 00:04:37.110
and animal welfare experts to inform

00:04:37.110 --> 00:04:39.078
farmers of the best practices

00:04:39.078 --> 00:04:40.280
for the situation.

00:04:40.280 --> 00:04:41.114
They say they've also opened up

00:04:41.114 --> 00:04:43.216
a health clinic with hundreds of people

00:04:43.216 --> 00:04:44.651
have already taken advantage of

00:04:44.651 --> 00:04:46.953
and can continue to take advantage of it.

00:04:47.287 --> 00:04:48.988
They also say that all the information

00:04:48.988 --> 00:04:50.089
all the testing,

00:04:50.089 --> 00:04:51.958
all the public information about best

00:04:51.958 --> 00:04:53.826
practices is all available,

00:04:53.826 --> 00:04:56.529
both online and in-person.

00:04:56.929 --> 00:04:57.330
Brianna.

